# beatmania IIDX (Twinkle, bmiidx2): first power-on from blank NVRAM. The device check passes
# everything but the backup RAM: E150 BACKUP DATA ERROR, then "1P START = BACKUP CLEAR"
# (by ~2300). 1P Start clears it and the game goes on to attract. Hashes the main RAM every
# frame and snapshots every 60 frames, for lockstep with MAME (PLAN.md section 21, TW-5).
game bmiidx2

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 2600 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 9000 quit
